x793 call open x792 6
x794 write x793 4
x795 write x794 2
x796 text "cm"
x797 puts x795 x796
x798 write x797 2
x799 text "# a view of clamp, then a reply that fixes the upper bound\n"
x800 puts x798 x799
x801 call close x800 
x802 write x801 2
x803 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x804 puts x802 x803
x805 call open x804 6
x806 write x805 4
x807 write x806 2
