x859 write x858 2
x860 text "Targets and CLI"
x861 puts x859 x860
x862 call close x861 
x863 call open x862 10
x864 write x863 4
x865 write x864 2
x866 text "code"
x867 puts x865 x866
x868 call open x867 4
